      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "After publication of the original article, authors found that there has been a minor mistake in the units of kcat and kcat/Km in Table 2. The units should be 103 min-1 g-1 FAE for kcat and mM-1 min-1 g-1 FAE for kcat/Km. This correction does not affect any conclusions drawn within the article."},
